# Raw OpenArt output. Thirty-eight generations, ~180 MB, most of them rejected
# explorations — too heavy to carry in git history forever.
#
# The masters for every image ACTUALLY IN USE are kept, as WebP at full
# resolution, in assets/masters/. Those are what the shipped cuts in
# site/assets/ are derived from, so nothing in the live site is unrecoverable.
#
# The rejected explorations stay on Sara's disk only. If one is ever wanted,
# it can be regenerated from the prompts in docs/imagery-directions.md.
assets/source-*.png
